               ╭ Keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
               │                                                                                        │
               │ Ctrl+P            Command palette          Ctrl+S            Save                      │
               │ F5 Ctrl+E         Run statement/selection  F1                Connection list           │
               │ Shift+F5          Run the whole script     Ctrl+T            Next theme                │
               │ Ctrl+Space        Suggest names            F12               Event log                 │
               │ Ctrl+R            Query history            Space             Command menu              │
               │ Ctrl+N            New query tab            ? F2              Show keys                 │
               │ Ctrl+W            Close query tab          Esc               Back / close              │
               │ Alt+] Ctrl+PgDn   Next query tab           q Ctrl+Q          Quit                      │
               │ Alt+[ Ctrl+PgUp   Previous query tab       Enter             Select / new line         │
               │ Ctrl+C            Copy / cancel query      ↑                 Up                        │
               │ y                 Copy as CSV, JSON, …     ↓                 Down                      │
               │ Ctrl+X            Cut                      ←                 Left / previous column    │
               │ Ctrl+V            Paste                    →                 Right / next column       │
               │ Ctrl+A            Select all               PgUp              Page up                   │
               │ V                 Select whole rows        PgDn              Page down                 │
               │ Ctrl+Z            Undo                     Home              First row / line start    │
               │ Ctrl+Y            Redo                     End               Last row / line end       │
               │ i                 Inspect / insert name    Backspace         Delete back               │
               │ >                 Widen column             Alt+Backspace     Delete a word             │
               │ <                 Narrow column            Alt+B Alt+←       Previous word             │
               │ Tab               Next panel               Alt+F Alt+→       Next word                 │
               │ Shift+Tab         Previous panel           Shift+←           Select left               │
               │ /                 Filter                   Shift+→           Select right              │
               │ R                 Refresh                  Shift+↑           Select up                 │
               │ n                 New connection           Shift+↓           Select down               │
               │ e                 Edit connection          Shift+Home        Select to line start      │
               │ Delete d          Delete connection        Shift+End         Select to line end        │
               │                                                                                        │
               ╰─────────────────────────────────── any key to close ───────────────────────────────────╯
